    "description": "The Investment Portfolio Allocations API enables users to access details about the allocation of assets within investment portfolios. This endpoint provides vital insights into how different investments are distributed across various asset categories, allowing asset managers and financial advisors to analyze and optimize portfolio performance. Typical consumers include financial institutions, portfolio managers, and analysts seeking to monitor or report on investment strategies. By leveraging this API, users can make informed decisions to enhance their portfolio management practices.",
